{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "b68b416aff333b4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And this is how I wish to bear everything that comes upon me, as though I were doing nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "509e3e175d00e287",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason, may the Lord forgive them, because they are our brothers and our fellow members, and because they too are weary in their ignorance, and because we too are distressed about them, because they have not served us for our bodily comfort."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "f463d0c6c4f6fedd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But those who live at all times in humility, joyfulness, patience, love, and willingness to learn, with complete submission, complete obedience, and every kind of usefulness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.004.0035",
      "source_sha256": "c01d2ebcf08866df",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is a great sign of perfection for a person to cut off his brother, his son, his daughter, his father, his mother, or anyone else belonging to him, for God's sake, whenever they sin against the one who created them, who is God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.004.0036",
      "source_sha256": "2187ac7818cc152a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And it is a great sign of strength for a person to love his enemies for God's sake, and to pray for those who pursue him to harm him, and, for God's sake, to bless those who curse him and sin against him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.004.0037",
      "source_sha256": "e24cfe5ba4a6a08a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And this is how he said it: “Let your brother be to you like a Gentile and a tax collector,” for God's sake, whenever he sins before the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.004.0038",
      "source_sha256": "6065052c79d7ea57",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But your enemy who sins against you—you are to love him and bless him for God's sake."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.004.0039",
      "source_sha256": "a1e51ac7952094db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But we too, brothers, insofar as we share fellowship with one another, are children of one person, who is God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.006.0009",
      "source_sha256": "9a372f53fef8989d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But now you say, “We see that your sin has risen against you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.007.0007",
      "source_sha256": "1e7d9ccabb29726b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May the Lord bless you and honor you through himself, through all his angels, through all the holy guests, and through everyone who comes to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0001",
      "source_sha256": "b321ccaa2a3896bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What is repentance except for us to turn away from every deceit and every disobedience, the root of every evil deed?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0002",
      "source_sha256": "3df41c943b46d82d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These things and all things like them—those who read them and those who hear them, or those who teach others from them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0003",
      "source_sha256": "5ec5fe1e0933bb8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while they themselves transgress all of them—these"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0004",
      "source_sha256": "968368cf1b4bf380",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of this sort, whether they are men,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0005",
      "source_sha256": "26968277b0ad5438",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or whether it is a woman, strip themselves naked"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0006",
      "source_sha256": "39fa6c96dcaf028c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and curse their own souls,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0021",
      "source_sha256": "28339dfb7d08f459",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "since they do not heal themselves through their own deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0035",
      "source_sha256": "21491d5f1eb17711",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, the person who is double-minded in his endurance is an abomination to God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0037",
      "source_sha256": "b81936a9c270e0c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as is the person who curses someone who pleads with God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0042",
      "source_sha256": "ffa06519f6ba4506",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again they pray to us as they do to God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0052",
      "source_sha256": "4622f10d8f722c7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how much of the blood of those they killed will come upon them!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0068",
      "source_sha256": "29459577bea41645",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As it is written, “The Father will judge no one.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0079",
      "source_sha256": "d1e99da572105721",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason, first of all, blessed is the Lord, because he teaches us through sufferings and scourges, as it is written,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0080",
      "source_sha256": "8b85631128cfea51",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "wishing us to know him rightly, as it is written,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0098",
      "source_sha256": "f8b93d80ba9042ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which Satan says within them, as it is written."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0099",
      "source_sha256": "831dfd584e42d52b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "For we are ready to punish every act of disobedience."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0104",
      "source_sha256": "0b77859442eab077",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "People who cover up one another’s sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0107",
      "source_sha256": "e88e03dcdfcc6850",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "So that he, in turn, will not rebuke him, saying, “It is godliness,” although it is godlessness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0127",
      "source_sha256": "366c3305fa5dc2bd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Cursed is anyone who runs to his neighbor, among us or among you yourselves, to wink at him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.008.0133",
      "source_sha256": "15e234f4230e9689",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Then Lot [?] our [?] to entrust them to us, while we take pleasure among little boys and among little girls."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.009.0020",
      "source_sha256": "7291674b25eeb49e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Therefore, brothers, let us not love one another in word and tongue alone, as those who went out from among us loved us in word and tongue."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.009.0024",
      "source_sha256": "48b89be2be2c11c7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "And let us not neglect those who are among us, lest God become angry with us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.009.0040",
      "source_sha256": "4ced236b347338e2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "And they be forgotten—that is, orphans and strangers who have no one here among us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.009.0065",
      "source_sha256": "7350507c0224a499",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Therefore, let no one among us, here with us or with you yourselves, show favoritism to anyone in any matter, whether in your dining place or in your place for the sick, lest you become a stumbling block to one another through malicious slander."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.010.0013",
      "source_sha256": "b9e4396865104321",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Or rather, he is the one they will care for."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.010.0071",
      "source_sha256": "f13549db9f91ded6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "But again, what are books that others have written as instruction?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.010.0077",
      "source_sha256": "923d54ee4216150c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Nevertheless, I too know that it is right to rejoice in the Lord at all times, as it is written."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.010.0084",
      "source_sha256": "7d64090020004858",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "For godly sorrow produces in us repentance without regret, leading to the salvation of our soul and our bodies."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.010.0100",
      "source_sha256": "06de2512f1ba1d5a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "“My soul is sorrowful to the point of death.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.011.0009",
      "source_sha256": "9e54fa4414d44571",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "And they will answer and say, “Because the one who watches over the whole earth…”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.011.0020",
      "source_sha256": "18799ec85643431f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "And again, he has removed wicked people from among us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_a22#CopScr.shenoute-a22.011.0027",
      "source_sha256": "1ab9b0f16c7caf13",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "And that they will not come upon anyone, as he himself says: “All these curses will come upon them at that time—or rather, now.”"
    }
  ]
}
